**Why:** User is also learning web development from scratch as they build this. All work serves dual purpose — ship useful features AND teach the user how the web works.

**How to apply:** Treat every feature as a learning opportunity. Keep scope small and iterative. The dashboard and upload features we are building now are Phase 2 foundations.
